## How this project is driven

This project runs on [cckit](https://cckit.dev). Every operation is a `cckit` verb you run in the
shell — read state with `cckit sync --llm` before acting, and append `--llm` to any verb for
machine-readable output. `cckit` installs no hooks, guards or specialist agents for Codex: nothing
blocks a commit to the base branch here, so the rules below are yours to follow.
<!-- IF:MEMORY -->
Memory hooks are not installed for Codex. If a MemPalace MCP server is configured, call its tools
explicitly (wing `{{WING}}`).
<!-- /IF:MEMORY --><!-- /IF:ADAPTER_CODEX -->

